step Deathstalker Masoj
  tip Back down to Masoj on the hillside above Dun Garok.
  turnin 98095                        -- Deathstalker Masoj

step The Sepulcher
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Walk back up to Tarren Mill and fly to the Sepulcher: Shadow Priest Allister stands by the crypt entrance.
  goto 60.21,18.75 map 1424 "Tarren Mill flight master"
  fly "The Sepulcher"
