  turnin 95981                        -- Shadow Priest Allister

step Fly to the Undercity
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Fly on from Karos Razok, the bat handler just east of the crypt, to the Undercity.
  fly "Undercity"
  zone Undercity

step Aelthalyste
  only Undead,Priest
  tip Aelthalyste stands in the War Quarter.
  turnin 5646 only Undead -- Aelthalyste: Dark Sacrifice

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Undercity
step Master Apothecary Faranell
  zone Undercity
  turnin 513                          -- Master Apothecary Faranell, in the Apothecarium
  accept 515 optional                 -- Keep it: the Hillsbrad coast, later on the route
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  vendor nearest

step Archibald
  only Warrior
  zone Undercity
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Warrior
  zone Undercity
  when level>=20
  when money>=1g
  when !skill "Polearms" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Polearms from Archibald (War Quarter, 1 gold); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Paladin
  zone Undercity
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); two-handers level a Paladin fastest.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Hunter
  zone Undercity
  when level>=20
  when money>=1g
  when !skill "Polearms" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Polearms from Archibald (War Quarter, 1 gold); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

step Archibald
  only Rogue
  zone Undercity
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Swords from Archibald (War Quarter, 10 silver); a sword in the main hand levels a Rogue steadily.
  train 11870                         -- Archibald

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tauren Druids: Aquatic Form
# Three steps, so no step's `when` turns false before its last goal is done: the hand-in of 30
# ends the first, the hand-in of 31 the second, and the third holds only in Thunder Bluff.
step Trial of the Sea Lion
  only Tauren,Druid
  zone Moonglade
  when onquest 30
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Join the two pendant halves at the Shrine of Remulos, on the north-west shore of the lake, before you see Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven. Dendrite stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  collect 15885 quest 30.1              -- Pendant of the Sea Lion: use a half at the Shrine of Remulos
  turnin 30                             -- Dendrite Starblaze

step Aquatic Form
  only Tauren,Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  when turnedin 30
  when !turnedin 31
  tip Take Aquatic Form from Dendrite Starblaze, who stands upstairs in his building. Then Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids to Thunder Bluff: Turak Runetotem is on Elder Rise.
  accept 31                             -- Dendrite Starblaze
  fly "Thunder Bluff"                   -- Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids there
  turnin 31                             -- Turak Runetotem: Aquatic Form

step Back to the Crossroads
  only Tauren,Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  when zone "Thunder Bluff"
  tip Train with Turak Runetotem, then fly on to the Crossroads, where the next guide starts.
  train class
  fly "Crossroads"

step Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  when !turnedin 31
  goto 60.7,58.9 "Zeppelin to Orgrimmar"

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  when !turnedin 31
  goto 51.5,45.6 "The middle of Orgrimmar"

step Orgrimmar
  only Hunter,Shaman
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Train before you fly on: the next guide flies from here to the Crossroads.
  train class
